[FINISH][!CLOSE] When finishing work on a feature, fix, or file change:

[REVIEW][!CODE-QUALITY] Examine new code; ensure it follows good Python coding practices.

[LINT][!CLEAN] Run the linter; ensure everything is clean.

[TEST][!PASS] Run unit tests; ensure they pass after cleanup and linting.